  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 14.7,
      "e": 21.7,
      "text": "It looks like they're just trying to finish up some gardening food check-ins so they're"
    },
    {
      "s": 21.7,
      "e": 40.21,
      "text": "getting pretty close."
    },
    {
      "s": 40.21,
      "e": 45.21,
      "text": "This is our last one that we're going to have before we have an integrated sim the next time"
    },
    {
      "s": 45.21,
      "e": 51.21,
      "text": "called our long sim which is going to be all the way through cryo-low term counts and"
    },
    {
      "s": 51.21,
      "e": 54.21,
      "text": "it's going to be prepared a little bit early."
    },
    {
      "s": 54.21,
      "e": 55.21,
      "text": "We are going to try to get out for lunch."
    },
    {
      "s": 55.21,
      "e": 58.21,
      "text": "In that first part we are going to have a cut off at some point."
    },
    {
      "s": 58.21,
      "e": 61.21,
      "text": "Then we get to recycle back to ten and we're going to have to-"
    },
    {
      "s": 61.21,
      "e": 63.21,
      "text": "This is our last stand-alone sim."
    },
    {
      "s": 63.21,
      "e": 65.21,
      "text": "So that's a big deal."
    },
    {
      "s": 65.21,
      "e": 71.21,
      "text": "Big deal because we're doing in our cross-program team mates, getting ready for lunch and so"
    },
    {
      "s": 71.21,
      "e": 74.21,
      "text": "we've been waiting for this milestone for quite some time."
    },
    {
      "s": 74.21,
      "e": 108.5,
      "text": "So there was an update for the TA, you got to meet up."
    },
    {
      "s": 108.5,
      "e": 118.91,
      "text": "You know, Hey were there any significant comments?"
    },
    {
      "s": 118.91,
      "e": 161.13,
      "text": "I think just try to try to get it down a little bit."
    },
    {
      "s": 161.13,
      "e": 168.13,
      "text": "I'm like, yeah, I'm not happy with that."
    },
    {
      "s": 168.13,
      "e": 172.13,
      "text": "Can you know what the good people are?"
    },
    {
      "s": 172.13,
      "e": 175.13,
      "text": "I'm not happy with the good people."
    },
    {
      "s": 175.13,
      "e": 181.32,
      "text": "See you in a second."
    },
    {
      "s": 181.32,
      "e": 184.32,
      "text": "Let's transfer."
    },
    {
      "s": 184.32,
      "e": 187.32,
      "text": "Put it down."
    },
    {
      "s": 187.32,
      "e": 190.32,
      "text": "And then like, don't worry, it's going to be safe."
    },
    {
      "s": 190.32,
      "e": 223.34,
      "text": "Hardly stop."
    },
    {
      "s": 223.34,
      "e": 226.34,
      "text": "Okay."
    }
